; trust/baseline.eadl — one form per item two roots share, as `cargo xtask trust-baseline --propose` measured it
; (docs/specs/trust/decision_trust-inventory.md §5, leaf M3.6.3.2). A proposal, never an acceptance: each
; form's classification, property, risk and controls are the review's to write, and which forms are accepted
; is read where reviews are protected (M3.6.5). The digests compare only on the host named below.

